/E (If there is no activation function, each layer of the neural network simply repeats linear operations \(y=Wx+b\). Even if you compose several linear functions, it will only end up as one large linear function. Such a model can never learn complex data patterns that cannot be separated by a straight line.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [15 16]
>>
