488 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (PyTorch's nn.CrossEntropyLoss is a combination of nn.LogSoftmax and nn.NLLLoss. This means that even if the raw values \(raw scores or logits\) output from the last layer of the model are received as input, it internally applies the Softmax function to convert them to probabilities and then calculates the loss. Therefore, when using this loss function, there is no need to add a Softmax layer at the end of the model.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [20 21]
>>
endobj
