746 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Optimizer is an object that automates this parameter update process. We just tell the optimizer 'which parameters to update' and 'which optimization algorithm to use'. Then, the optimizer automatically updates all parameters according to the specified algorithm using the gradients \(w.grad, b.grad, etc.\) calculated by loss.backward\(\).)
/E (Optimizer is an object that automates this parameter update process. We just tell the optimizer 'which parameters to update' and 'which optimization algorithm to use'. Then, the optimizer automatically updates all parameters according to the specified algorithm using the gradients \(w.grad, b.grad, etc.\) calculated by loss.backward\(\).)
/Alt ()
/Pg 38 0 R
/K [4 5]
>>
